  "reviews": [
    "{\"supported\":false,\"issues\":[\"Candidate answer: the statement that the block remained active while the screen showed 'not blocked' is cited only to [ui_client.txt:L51], which shows displayed_enabled=false and a display validity to 12:03:35. It does not show the effective SEC-7 state. Cite the effective-state record, such as [sniffer.csv:L193]/[sniffer.csv:L205] or [calc:region:case_005:1], in this answer.\",\"Candidate answer: the claim that the rejection result 'did not reach the display' is cited only to [ui_client.txt:L51]. That record does not show that the rejection was not delivered. The supporting evidence for the internal non-subscription (ui_subscribed=false, e.g. [ui_client.txt:L59] and [control_gateway.txt:L6]) is not cited in this answer, so the display-delivery link is unsupported as written.\",\"Candidate answer: the software-format mismatch is not explained. The answer omits that the cancellation was sent as sector.v2 while config-service 1.4.0 supports only sector.v1, and it does not name the rejected request (req-303). [config_service.txt:L7] contains these facts and should be used in the visible answer.\",\"Candidate answer: the claim that the display kept showing 'not blocked' after the rejection relies on [ui_client.txt:L51], whose validity ends at 12:03:35. The answer does not explain the later display state (for example 12:04:10 or the 12:03:30 snapshot's validity window), so the duration of the conflicting display is not established from the cited records.\"]}",
    "{\"supported\":true,\"issues\":[]}"
  ],
  "answer": {
    "id": "157eaf9a-52de-4791-a369-b14f552ea701",
    "role": "assistant",
    "text": "הממשק הציג \"אין חסימה\" כי הסיר את סימון SEC-7 מיד עם קבלת בקשת הביטול (req-303), בלי לאמת שהשינוי יושם. השדה applied_state_verified היה false, והמסך הציג את האזור כפתוח [ui_client.txt:L43] [ui_client.txt:L51].\n\nהבקשה נשלחה בסכמה sector.v2, אבל שירות התצורה בגרסה 1.4.0 תומך רק ב-sector.v1, ולכן דחה אותה כ-UNSUPPORTED_SCHEMA ולא יישם אותה [config_service.txt:L7] [control_gateway.txt:L6]. הממשק לא היה מנוי לתוצאות היישום, ולכן הדחייה לא עודכנה במסך [ui_client.txt:L45] [control_gateway.txt:L6].\n\nהחסימה נשארה פעילה בפועל: במצב האפקטיבי של הרדאר, SEC-7 רשום כ-enabled=true בטווח 35°–50° [sniffer.csv:L205] [calc:region:case_005:1]. לכן הסימון על המסך לא שיקף את מצב הרדאר.",
